{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "License To Clone",
    "steam_appid": 964090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">License To Clone is a <strong>challenging</strong> Open World Sandbox Survival RPG, created to explore science fiction scenarios in a huge open world, where every decision, every action and every non-action has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed as an open world sandbox where no correct way to play exists, opening up the game to your own exploration, experimentation and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The factions, towns and characters within the world are all impacted by the players decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/de42d00716ef972c303e1cf3ad39001b.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/17c64b990d63b503b771e1ea1e822f72.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in a huge open world of 4 million tiles, no loading screens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build anywhere and everywhere to help survive, but watch out not to trespass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many challenges and dangers, including huge killer mantis, the deadly desert sun and spliced mutated clones running rampant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/1eab30280c2d7d556db5fbb55c3bf5b9.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/e25077831504afc7e9a0cdc7c522890f.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tame creatures or rescue fellow clones, grow your squad or stay solo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 22 unique species with different traits and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Founders are the ruling humanoids with huge health pools and the ability to build using money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mutated clones are failed clones which have unlocked physical and mental mutations, some with the ability to control other peoples minds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage the temperament of creatures and tame them by dropping their favourite food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic quests from squad members to help grow loyalty and learn more about your travelling companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance adventure with relaxing time, ensuring your squads morale doesn't drop too low which can result in splitting up your team</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/cea75356be3b84b7a4274ca6bf411e0f.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/82cb2f25ed28234925952dd7b0bbe7df.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every creature has unique species traits, abilities, mutations and body parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment on the splicing table to remove powerful body parts such as the phoenix beak which provides the wearer with intermittent fire breathe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip powerful body parts as makeshift weapons, or for their useful traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use mutations to peer into locked containers, send enemies to sleep, and much much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/49691141cb4a5a63f1ef516623b20dc1.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/a332b5cc908ac8ae9e9f0902fba6073c.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Extract the DNA and mutations of powerful creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine DNA into different spliced creatures, combining the best of two species</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the cloning pods to create countless creatures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build an automated lab, which grows clones and destroys them for their resources</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/c7e9017ff0635281e8ad1cab38482d55.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/f965f95bc542dac24cc9c314bef2fa91.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Several main factions with differing laws, religions and leaders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose to ally or become enemies with any faction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kill faction leaders and see their town become taken over by their enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your own faction and become emperor by defeating the current emperor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/c9e9b3c41fdeac6e5b2e23745cd64fa8.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/e8a33b32416236723e656d833820807d.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade with town shopkeepers, the armourer, survivalist or black market shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a sneaky thief and hack into shops supplies to steal them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decrease or increase the economy of a town through countless selling and mining seeing the town change dynamically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape the desert by defeating town leaders to change what species are spawning there. Ever seen a town run by cats?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">License To Clone is a <strong>challenging</strong> Open World Sandbox Survival RPG, created to explore science fiction scenarios in a huge open world, where every decision, every action and every non-action has consequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is designed as an open world sandbox where no correct way to play exists, opening up the game to your own exploration, experimentation and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The factions, towns and characters within the world are all impacted by the players decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/de42d00716ef972c303e1cf3ad39001b.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/17c64b990d63b503b771e1ea1e822f72.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in a huge open world of 4 million tiles, no loading screens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build anywhere and everywhere to help survive, but watch out not to trespass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many challenges and dangers, including huge killer mantis, the deadly desert sun and spliced mutated clones running rampant.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/1eab30280c2d7d556db5fbb55c3bf5b9.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/e25077831504afc7e9a0cdc7c522890f.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tame creatures or rescue fellow clones, grow your squad or stay solo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 22 unique species with different traits and abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Founders are the ruling humanoids with huge health pools and the ability to build using money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mutated clones are failed clones which have unlocked physical and mental mutations, some with the ability to control other peoples minds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage the temperament of creatures and tame them by dropping their favourite food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic quests from squad members to help grow loyalty and learn more about your travelling companions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Balance adventure with relaxing time, ensuring your squads morale doesn't drop too low which can result in splitting up your team</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/cea75356be3b84b7a4274ca6bf411e0f.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/82cb2f25ed28234925952dd7b0bbe7df.avif?t=1746587065\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every creature has unique species traits, abilities, mutations and body parts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment on the splicing table to remove powerful body parts such as the phoenix beak which provides the wearer with intermittent fire breathe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip powerful body parts as makeshift weapons, or for their useful traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use mutations to peer into locked containers, send enemies to sleep, and much much more</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/964090/extras/49691141cb4a5a63f