<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade with town shopkeepers, the armourer, survivalist or black market shops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be a sneaky thief and hack into shops supplies to steal them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decrease or increase the economy of a town through countless selling and mining seeing the town change dynamically</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shape the desert by defeating town leaders to change what species are spawning there. Ever seen a town run by cats?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p>",
